<title>UK: UK's Albert Fisher to buy Howard Intl.</title>
<headline>UK's Albert Fisher to buy Howard Intl.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British food processing and distribution group Albert Fisher said on Tuesday that it had signed an agreement to acquire Howard Long International for an estimated cash consideration of 26.9 million stg. </p>
<p>Albert Fisher said HLI, a producer of chilled prepared dry salads based in Norfolk, posted pre-tax profit of 1.9 million stg last year and had net assets of 3.0 million.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
